  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1742708771_6756253_9cd2013b5865d876acda5f6406345677.png",
  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&bull; Brand introduction:&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; box-sizing: inherit; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Mommy AF is more than a brand &mdash; it&rsquo;s a movement. We&rsquo;re a fierce community of moms redefining motherhood on our own terms. Raw, real, and unapologetically powerful, we celebrate every version of motherhood &mdash; from the chaos to the calm, the tears to the triumphs. Whether you&rsquo;re covered in baby food or running your own empire (or both), you&rsquo;re not alone. You&rsquo;re Mommy AF &mdash; and that&rsquo;s something to be damn proud of.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; box-sizing: inherit; caret-color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Our Mission</strong></span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">To empower, uplift, and unite mothers through bold representation, real talk, and products that speak truth to the messy, magical experience of motherhood. We&rsquo;re here to normalize the unfiltered reality and remind every mom: you are enough, you are powerful, and you are never alone.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; caret-color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Our Vision</strong></span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">To create a world where moms feel seen, supported, and celebrated for who they are &mdash; not just what they do. We envision a global sisterhood that embraces authenticity, honors individuality, and reclaims the narrative around motherhood with unapologetic confidence.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; Product description: Apparel</span><br><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): Mom apparel for the next generation</span><br><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; Payment terms: Once a Month</span><br><br></p>",
